# Bullseye, Death Dealer: "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact or discard a nonland card: Bullseye deals 2 damage to any target." (CR 602.2b,
# 118.3.) Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (declining the enter trigger) and on turn 3, with the Moxen untapped, activates it: of the two ways
# of paying, both possible, it chooses to discard, and Lightning Bolt is the only card it may name. The cost is paid at once, so the
# card is in the graveyard before the ability resolves; Bot2 then takes 2 damage. No artifact is sacrificed.

